ding-into-a-timed-public-performance-evaluated-thr--a575bceeaf8e->claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\nsupports:claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5->claim-smoothing-relaxation-and-cushion-shading-let-users-adjust-whether-bundles-appear--f208f3204963\nsupports:claim-the-lago-implementation-supports-interactive-zooming-panning-normalization-contr--0c65d7666097->claim-the-visualization-examples-reveal-interpretable-patterns-in-real-graph-datasets--6f7b292bd09e\nsupports:claim-the-rendering-complexity-remains-linear-in-input-size-with-seed-point-rectangle--8a6cf3a6542e->claim-measured-overview-rendering-stayed-below-one-second-for-several-datasets-up-to-a--d5763f10ba50\nsupports:claim-the-survey-classifies-90-published-foveated-rendering-reports-from-1990-to-2021--d0734ae4812f->claim-a-useful-taxonomy-for-foveated-rendering-classifies-methods-by-required-input-da--a46ce25de499\nsupports:claim-the-tested-system-renders-10-000-different-humans-in-a-41-260-polygon-village-at--6845dedcbaed->claim-image-based-impostor-rendering-with-positional-and-directional-discretization-ca--3b5de902e034\nsupports:claim-visual-acuity-models-and-contrast-sensitivity-models-are-the-two-representative--544eac975fd9->claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
