{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'set -euo pipefail\nout=/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/graphics/outputs/space_overview/subspace--graphics/overview.json\nmkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$out\")\"\ncat > \"$out\" <<'\"'JSON'\n{\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"space_overview_v1\\\",\n  \\\"metadata\\\": {\n    \\\"overview_id\\\": \\\"subspace--graphics\\\",\n    \\\"scope_kind\\\": \\\"subspace\\\",\n    \\\"space_name\\\": \\\"graphics\\\",\n    \\\"scope_name\\\": \\\"graphics\\\",\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"State of the Evidence in Graphics\\\",\n    \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The graphics subspace centers on real-time visual computation: shader-based image generation, image-space approximations for crowds and graphs, and perceptually guided rendering strategies that trade full detail for interactive, interpretable, or performable images.\\\"\n  },\n  \\\"sections\\\": [\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"topic_framing\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Topic framing\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The scoped evidence frames graphics as a field where mathematical structure, hardware pipelines, perceptual limits, and visual abstraction are coordinated to make complex scenes intelligible in real time. Shadercoding presents the most direct version of this frame: a shader is described as GPU-directed rendering logic, and fragment shaders can turn pixel coordinates, time, and inputs into animated mathematical images. The more applied sources extend the same frame to virtual crowds, foveated VR, edge bundling, and large graph drawings, where image-space or perceptual reductions help sustain interactivity instead of rendering every possible detail at uniform fidelity.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-a-shader-is-a-gpu-directed-program-that-describes-rendering-processes-for-turnin--64c2250afac1\\\",\n        \\\"claim-fragment-shaders-map-two-dimensional-pixel-positions-to-colors-and-can-generate--ff479c9f654e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-image-based-impostor-rendering-with-positional-and-directional-discretization-ca--3b5de902e034\\\",\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n        \\\"claim-straight-line-graph-drawings-can-be-rendered-interactively-with-adjustable-level--d4a598a6ca79\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"key_themes\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Key themes\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"Several themes recur across the corpus. First, GPU and image-space computation repeatedly act as enabling media: raymarching reconstructs apparent 3D depth inside fragment shaders, CUDA accelerates skeleton-based edge bundling, and OpenGL accumulation fields support graph level of detail without extra hierarchy storage. Second, abstraction is productive rather than merely reductive: impostors stand in for dense animated crowds, skeletons steer bundles through local structure, and foveated rendering intentionally varies quality by visual region. Third, constraints can be generative: the shadercoding evidence explicitly treats mathematical and technical limits as creative motors, while the system papers turn memory, latency, and overdraw constraints into design rules.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-raymarching-can-recreate-three-dimensional-depth-inside-a-fragment-shader-by-mar--eb7e615f4e18\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-two-pass-accumulation-field-method-fits-directly-into-the-opengl-pipeline-and--bf684a8c9b90\\\",\n        \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeletons-of-inflated-edge-cluster-shapes-provide-locally-centered-targets-for-b--27f82ed32127\\\",\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-methods-span-multiple-data-types-foveation-principles-and-ren--0c481572e2ab\\\",\n        \\\"claim-opengl-compressed-textures-and-compact-frame-storage-allow-ten-human-types-with--0cc37130330a\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"agreement_and_disagreement\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Agreement and disagreement\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The sources broadly agree that graphics systems gain scale by accepting controlled approximations. Crowd impostors, foveated rendering, skeleton-based edge bundling, and large-graph level-of-detail methods all replace uniform geometric or visual fidelity with context-sensitive representations. The disagreement is not a direct contradiction in the evidence but a difference in what each method is willing to lose: foveated rendering aims to preserve perceived quality while lowering peripheral detail, edge bundling explicitly accepts overdraw and direction distortion for coarse connectivity exploration, and crowd rendering manages popping, texture memory, and variety through impostor corrections and compressed storage. Shadercoding adds a complementary stance by treating constraints as part of the aesthetic and performative value, not only as engineering compromises.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-perturbing-an-impostor-plane-toward-a-pca-derived-best-fitting-plane-reduces-vie--e9f84568a82e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-packing-each-prerendered-human-sample-into-the-smallest-containing-rectangle-red--c2027548dc18\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"methods_and_evidence\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Methods and evidence\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The evidence base combines survey synthesis, algorithmic construction, performance measurement, and practice-based exposition. The foveated-rendering source classifies 90 reports from 1990 to 2021 into a three-dimensional taxonomy of input data, foveation principle, and rendering paradigm. The crowd-rendering source reports a concrete benchmark: 10,000 different humans in a 41,260-polygon village at 12 to 20 frames per second, supported by texture packing, compression, recoloring, and impostor-plane correction. The graph sources give algorithmic pipelines and measured scalability, including image-space distance transforms for skeleton bundling and linear-cost or sub-second overview rendering for large graph datasets. The shadercoding source supplies the conceptual and technical vocabulary connecting GPU programs, mathematical fluency, raymarching, and live performance.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-the-survey-classifies-90-published-foveated-rendering-reports-from-1990-to-2021--d0734ae4812f\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-useful-taxonomy-for-foveated-rendering-classifies-methods-by-required-input-da--a46ce25de499\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-tested-system-renders-10-000-different-humans-in-a-41-260-polygon-village-at--6845dedcbaed\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alpha-channel-multipass-rendering-can-recolor-significant-body-regions-such-as-c--265615107527\\\",\n        \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-rendering-complexity-remains-linear-in-input-size-with-seed-point-rectangle--8a6cf3a6542e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-measured-overview-rendering-stayed-below-one-second-for-several-datasets-up-to-a--d5763f10ba50\\\",\n        \\\"claim-creating-original-shaders-requires-substantial-mathematical-and-technical-fluenc--7ec21177eabc\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"open_questions\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Open questions\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The clearest open agenda comes from foveated rendering, where future work is described as needing broader human-visual features, improved gaze and AI techniques, better handling of new data types, more suitable rendering paradigms, stronger objective quality metrics, and deeper AR and task-oriented applications. The graph-visualization sources also leave open how users should calibrate the tradeoff between overview legibility and individual-edge faithfulness, especially when bundling overdraws edges or level-of-detail aggregation hides inner-cluster connections. Across the subspace, a larger question is how transferable the demonstrated successes are: shader performance, virtual-city crowds, skeleton-bundled graphs, foveated displays, and large graph renderers each show strong local solutions, but the context does not yet provide a unified evaluation standard for comparing visual quality, interaction cost, and information loss across domains.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-future-foveated-rendering-work-needs-broader-use-of-human-visual-features-improv--36729372977e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-edge-endpoints-can-be-aggregated-by-hill-climbing-on-the-node-density-field-so-t--6e6b82bcec81\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-lago-implementation-supports-interactive-zooming-panning-normalization-contr--0c65d7666097\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \\\"references\\\": {\n    \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n      \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n      \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n      \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n      \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n      \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n    ],\n    \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n      \\\"claim-a-shader-is-a-gpu-directed-program-that-describes-rendering-processes-for-turnin--64c2250afac1\\\",\n      \\\"claim-fragment-shaders-map-two-dimensional-pixel-positions-to-colors-and-can-generate--ff479c9f654e\\\",\n      \\\"claim-raymarching-can-recreate-three-dimensional-depth-inside-a-fragment-shader-by-mar--eb7e615f4e18\\\",\n      \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\",\n      \\\"claim-creating-original-shaders-requires-substantial-mathematical-and-technical-fluenc--7ec21177eabc\\\",\n      \\\"claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\\\",\n      \\\"claim-image-based-impostor-rendering-with-positional-and-directional-discretization-ca--3b5de902e034\\\",\n      \\\"claim-opengl-compressed-textures-and-compact-frame-storage-allow-ten-human-types-with--0cc37130330a\\\",\n      \\\"claim-perturbing-an-impostor-plane-toward-a-pca-derived-best-fitting-plane-reduces-vie--e9f84568a82e\\\",\n      \\\"claim-packing-each-prerendered-human-sample-into-the-smallest-containing-rectangle-red--c2027548dc18\\\",\n      \\\"claim-the-tested-system-renders-10-000-different-humans-in-a-41-260-polygon-village-at--6845dedcbaed\\\",\n      \\\"claim-alpha-channel-multipass-rendering-can-recolor-significant-body-regions-such-as-c--265615107527\\\",\n      \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n      \\\"claim-skeletons-of-inflated-edge-cluster-shapes-provide-locally-centered-targets-for-b--27f82ed32127\\\",\n      \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n      \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n      \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-methods-span-multiple-data-types-foveation-principles-and-ren--0c481572e2ab\\\",\n      \\\"claim-the-survey-classifies-90-published-foveated-rendering-reports-from-1990-to-2021--d0734ae4812f\\\",\n      \\\"claim-a-useful-taxonomy-for-foveated-rendering-classifies-methods-by-required-input-da--a46ce25de499\\\",\n      \\\"claim-future-foveated-rendering-work-needs-broader-use-of-human-visual-features-improv--36729372977e\\\",\n      \\\"claim-straight-line-graph-drawings-can-be-rendered-interactively-with-adjustable-level--d4a598a6ca79\\\",\n      \\\"claim-a-two-pass-accumulation-field-method-fits-directly-into-the-opengl-pipeline-and--bf684a8c9b90\\\",\n      \\\"claim-the-rendering-complexity-remains-linear-in-input-size-with-seed-point-rectangle--8a6cf3a6542e\\\",\n      \\\"claim-measured-overview-rendering-stayed-below-one-second-for-several-datasets-up-to-a--d5763f10ba50\\\",\n      \\\"claim-edge-endpoints-can-be-aggregated-by-hill-climbing-on-the-node-density-field-so-t--6e6b82bcec81\\\",\n      \\\"claim-the-lago-implementation-supports-interactive-zooming-panning-normalization-contr--0c65d7666097\\\"\n    ],\n    \\\"citation_anchors\\\": [\n      {\n        \\\"anchor_id\\\": \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"[S1]\\\",\n        \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n          \\\"claim-a-shader-is-a-gpu-directed-program-that-describes-rendering-processes-for-turnin--64c2250afac1\\\",\n          \\\"claim-fragment-shaders-map-two-dimensional-pixel-positions-to-colors-and-can-generate--ff479c9f654e\\\",\n          \\\"claim-raymarching-can-recreate-three-dimensional-depth-inside-a-fragment-shader-by-mar--eb7e615f4e18\\\",\n          \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\",\n          \\\"claim-creating-original-shaders-requires-substantial-mathematical-and-technical-fluenc--7ec21177eabc\\\",\n          \\\"claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\\\"\n        ],\n        \\\"locator\\\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \\\"anchor_id\\\": \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"[S2]\\\",\n        \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n          \\\"claim-image-based-impostor-rendering-with-positional-and-directional-discretization-ca--3b5de902e034\\\",\n          \\\"claim-opengl-compressed-textures-and-compact-frame-storage-allow-ten-human-types-with--0cc37130330a\\\",\n          \\\"claim-perturbing-an-impostor-plane-toward-a-pca-derived-best-fitting-plane-reduces-vie--e9f84568a82e\\\",\n          \\\"claim-packing-each-prerendered-human-sample-into-the-smallest-containing-rectangle-red--c2027548dc18\\\",\n          \\\"claim-the-tested-system-renders-10-000-different-humans-in-a-41-260-polygon-village-at--6845dedcbaed\\\",\n          \\\"claim-alpha-channel-multipass-rendering-can-recolor-significant-body-regions-such-as-c--265615107527\\\"\n        ],\n        \\\"locator\\\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \\\"anchor_id\\\": \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"[S3]\\\",\n        \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n          \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n          \\\"claim-skeletons-of-inflated-edge-cluster-shapes-provide-locally-centered-targets-for-b--27f82ed32127\\\",\n          \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\"\n        ],\n        \\\"locator\\\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \\\"anchor_id\\\": \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"[S4]\\\",\n        \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n          \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n          \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-methods-span-multiple-data-types-foveation-principles-and-ren--0c481572e2ab\\\",\n          \\\"claim-the-survey-classifies-90-published-foveated-rendering-reports-from-1990-to-2021--d0734ae4812f\\\",\n          \\\"claim-a-useful-taxonomy-for-foveated-rendering-classifies-methods-by-required-input-da--a46ce25de499\\\",\n          \\\"claim-future-foveated-rendering-work-needs-broader-use-of-human-visual-features-improv--36729372977e\\\"\n        ],\n        \\\"locator\\\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \\\"anchor_id\\\": \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\",\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"[S5]\\\",\n        \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\",\n        \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n          \\\"claim-straight-line-graph-drawings-can-be-rendered-interactively-with-adjustable-level--d4a598a6ca79\\\",\n          \\\"claim-a-two-pass-accumulation-field-method-fits-directly-into-the-opengl-pipeline-and--bf684a8c9b90\\\",\n          \\\"claim-the-rendering-complexity-remains-linear-in-input-size-with-seed-point-rectangle--8a6cf3a6542e\\\",\n          \\\"claim-measured-overview-rendering-stayed-below-one-second-for-several-datasets-up-to-a--d5763f10ba50\\\",\n          \\\"claim-edge-endpoints-can-be-aggregated-by-hill-climbing-on-the-node-density-field-so-t--6e6b82bcec81\\\",\n          \\\"claim-the-lago-implementation-supports-interactive-zooming-panning-normalization-contr--0c65d7666097\\\"\n        ],\n        \\\"locator\\\": null\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \\\"freshness\\\": {\n    \\\"generated_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-26T18:20:02Z\\\",\n    \\\"input_signature\\\": \\\"sha256:4ed1f908168ddb9e1658a9b64fcf4f3d7acc33ab1cdc1408e0d2cc6058cbc0b7\\\",\n    \\\"source_record_count\\\": 5,\n    \\\"claim_count\\\": 42,\n    \\\"relation_count\\\": 24,\n    \\\"topic_count\\\": 14\n  },\n  \\\"warnings\\\": [\n    \\\"subspaces.json was not present in the provided context, so child-subspace structure was not assessed.\\\"\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'set -euo pipefail\nout=/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/graphics/outputs/space_overview/subspace--graphics/overview.json\nmkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$out\")\"\ncat > \"$out\" <<'\"'JSON'\n{\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"space_overview_v1\\\",\n  \\\"metadata\\\": {\n    \\\"overview_id\\\": \\\"subspace--graphics\\\",\n    \\\"scope_kind\\\": \\\"subspace\\\",\n    \\\"space_name\\\": \\\"graphics\\\",\n    \\\"scope_name\\\": \\\"graphics\\\",\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"State of the Evidence in Graphics\\\",\n    \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The graphics subspace centers on real-time visual computation: shader-based image generation, image-space approximations for crowds and graphs, and perceptually guided rendering strategies that trade full detail for interactive, interpretable, or performable images.\\\"\n  },\n  \\\"sections\\\": [\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"topic_framing\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Topic framing\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The scoped evidence frames graphics as a field where mathematical structure, hardware pipelines, perceptual limits, and visual abstraction are coordinated to make complex scenes intelligible in real time. Shadercoding presents the most direct version of this frame: a shader is described as GPU-directed rendering logic, and fragment shaders can turn pixel coordinates, time, and inputs into animated mathematical images. The more applied sources extend the same frame to virtual crowds, foveated VR, edge bundling, and large graph drawings, where image-space or perceptual reductions help sustain interactivity instead of rendering every possible detail at uniform fidelity.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-a-shader-is-a-gpu-directed-program-that-describes-rendering-processes-for-turnin--64c2250afac1\\\",\n        \\\"claim-fragment-shaders-map-two-dimensional-pixel-positions-to-colors-and-can-generate--ff479c9f654e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-image-based-impostor-rendering-with-positional-and-directional-discretization-ca--3b5de902e034\\\",\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n        \\\"claim-straight-line-graph-drawings-can-be-rendered-interactively-with-adjustable-level--d4a598a6ca79\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"key_themes\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Key themes\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"Several themes recur across the corpus. First, GPU and image-space computation repeatedly act as enabling media: raymarching reconstructs apparent 3D depth inside fragment shaders, CUDA accelerates skeleton-based edge bundling, and OpenGL accumulation fields support graph level of detail without extra hierarchy storage. Second, abstraction is productive rather than merely reductive: impostors stand in for dense animated crowds, skeletons steer bundles through local structure, and foveated rendering intentionally varies quality by visual region. Third, constraints can be generative: the shadercoding evidence explicitly treats mathematical and technical limits as creative motors, while the system papers turn memory, latency, and overdraw constraints into design rules.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-raymarching-can-recreate-three-dimensional-depth-inside-a-fragment-shader-by-mar--eb7e615f4e18\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-two-pass-accumulation-field-method-fits-directly-into-the-opengl-pipeline-and--bf684a8c9b90\\\",\n        \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeletons-of-inflated-edge-cluster-shapes-provide-locally-centered-targets-for-b--27f82ed32127\\\",\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-methods-span-multiple-data-types-foveation-principles-and-ren--0c481572e2ab\\\",\n        \\\"claim-opengl-compressed-textures-and-compact-frame-storage-allow-ten-human-types-with--0cc37130330a\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"agreement_and_disagreement\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Agreement and disagreement\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The sources broadly agree that graphics systems gain scale by accepting controlled approximations. Crowd impostors, foveated rendering, skeleton-based edge bundling, and large-graph level-of-detail methods all replace uniform geometric or visual fidelity with context-sensitive representations. The disagreement is not a direct contradiction in the evidence but a difference in what each method is willing to lose: foveated rendering aims to preserve perceived quality while lowering peripheral detail, edge bundling explicitly accepts overdraw and direction distortion for coarse connectivity exploration, and crowd rendering manages popping, texture memory, and variety through impostor corrections and compressed storage. Shadercoding adds a complementary stance by treating constraints as part of the aesthetic and performative value, not only as engineering compromises.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-foveated-rendering-can-accelerate-rendering-by-giving-the-foveal-region-high-qua--d710634b4892\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-perturbing-an-impostor-plane-toward-a-pca-derived-best-fitting-plane-reduces-vie--e9f84568a82e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-packing-each-prerendered-human-sample-into-the-smallest-containing-rectangle-red--c2027548dc18\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"methods_and_evidence\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Methods and evidence\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The evidence base combines survey synthesis, algorithmic construction, performance measurement, and practice-based exposition. The foveated-rendering source classifies 90 reports from 1990 to 2021 into a three-dimensional taxonomy of input data, foveation principle, and rendering paradigm. The crowd-rendering source reports a concrete benchmark: 10,000 different humans in a 41,260-polygon village at 12 to 20 frames per second, supported by texture packing, compression, recoloring, and impostor-plane correction. The graph sources give algorithmic pipelines and measured scalability, including image-space distance transforms for skeleton bundling and linear-cost or sub-second overview rendering for large graph datasets. The shadercoding source supplies the conceptual and technical vocabulary connecting GPU programs, mathematical fluency, raymarching, and live performance.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-the-survey-classifies-90-published-foveated-rendering-reports-from-1990-to-2021--d0734ae4812f\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-useful-taxonomy-for-foveated-rendering-classifies-methods-by-required-input-da--a46ce25de499\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-tested-system-renders-10-000-different-humans-in-a-41-260-polygon-village-at--6845dedcbaed\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alpha-channel-multipass-rendering-can-recolor-significant-body-regions-such-as-c--265615107527\\\",\n        \\\"claim-cuda-image-space-distance-transforms-skeletonization-path-computation-and-attrac--46de973cba61\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-rendering-complexity-remains-linear-in-input-size-with-seed-point-rectangle--8a6cf3a6542e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-measured-overview-rendering-stayed-below-one-second-for-several-datasets-up-to-a--d5763f10ba50\\\",\n        \\\"claim-creating-original-shaders-requires-substantial-mathematical-and-technical-fluenc--7ec21177eabc\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-crowd-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"section_id\\\": \\\"open_questions\\\",\n      \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Open questions\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The clearest open agenda comes from foveated rendering, where future work is described as needing broader human-visual features, improved gaze and AI techniques, better handling of new data types, more suitable rendering paradigms, stronger objective quality metrics, and deeper AR and task-oriented applications. The graph-visualization sources also leave open how users should calibrate the tradeoff between overview legibility and individual-edge faithfulness, especially when bundling overdraws edges or level-of-detail aggregation hides inner-cluster connections. Across the subspace, a larger question is how transferable the demonstrated successes are: shader performance, virtual-city crowds, skeleton-bundled graphs, foveated displays, and large graph renderers each show strong local solutions, but the context does not yet provide a unified evaluation standard for comparing visual quality, interaction cost, and information loss across domains.\\\",\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n        \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-future-foveated-rendering-work-needs-broader-use-of-human-visual-features-improv--36729372977e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-edge-endpoints-can-be-aggregated-by-hill-climbing-on-the-node-density-field-so-t--6e6b82bcec81\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-lago-implementation-supports-interactive-zooming-panning-normalization-contr--0c65d7666097\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"citation_anchor_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"anchor-shadercoding\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-edge-bundling\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-foveated-rendering\\\",\n        \\\"anchor-large-graph-lod\\\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \\\"references\\\": {\n    \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n      \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\",\n      \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n      \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n      \\\"source-04-foveated-rendering-a-state-of-the-art-survey--2a4e30f52f30\\\",\n      \\\"source-05-interactive-level-of-detail-rendering-of-large-graphs--df4eb719b5f7\\\"\n    ],\n    \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n      \\\"claim-a-shader-is-a-gpu-directed-program-that-describes-rendering-processes-for-turnin--64c2250afac1\\\",\n      \\\"claim-fragment-shaders-map-two-dimensional-pixel-positions-to-colors-and-can-generate--ff479c9f654e\\\",\n      \\\"claim-raymarching-can-recreate-three-dimensional-depth-inside-a-fragment-shader-by-mar--eb7e615f4e18\\\",\n      \\\"claim-mathematical-